abstract: >
  FSM-Bench-20 is a reproducible benchmark of 20 natural-language requirement
  specifications for evaluating open-weight LLMs on guarded finite-state machine
  generation under local Ollama inference. The public replication package
  includes the dataset, prompt specification, FSM JSON schema, evaluation
  scripts with conservative guard-aware determinism (M0–M3), criterion freeze,
  unit tests, campaign manifests, aggregate metrics summaries, and per-group
  diagnostics for the 140-run campaign freeze (manifest 20260602T195520Z;
  nested rates G1 98.6%, G2 78.6%, M0 31.4%, M1 33.6%). Full per-pair CSV
  records and raw/cleaned model outputs are size-excluded from the public
  archive.
